 of C's egocentric behavior impact. That would be a tool call. But we need to produce a public message after the tool call. However we can also just state we don't have concrete examples. The instruction: \"If you do not have information, say so directly.\" So we can say we don't have concrete examples of C's egocentric behavior impact.\n\nWe need to give a recommendation. Likely we keep C. Provide reasoning: reliability, decision speed, positive crew atmosphere outweigh concerns. Also note lack of concrete examples of C's egocentric impact, but still maintain C.\n\nThus public message: I agree with Agent 1, maintain C, note we have no concrete examples of C's egocentric behavior affecting crew, but given positive atmosphere, still recommend C. Also maybe ask for any further info on B's tone issues, but we already asked earlier. Could ask again.\n\nWe must include metadata with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
